  "itemGroup.assortedtools": "Assorted Tools",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.armor": "Armor",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.armor.armor": "A full four piece set for every material this mod adds tools for, on the same ladder the tools use.",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.armor.armor.title": "Armor Sets",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials": "Gear Sets",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials.basic": "Pickaxe, axe, shovel, hoe and sword, in every material. They behave exactly as the vanilla ones do.",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials.basic.title": "The Basic Set",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials.materials": "Every metal and gem Assorted Core adds gets a full tool set here, so tin, silver, bronze, steel, ruby and the rest of them.\n\nVanilla's own materials are not repeated as pickaxes and swords, since the game already has those. They do turn up in the tools vanilla has no version of though like hammers, multitools, shears, spears and buckets all go from wood up to netherite.",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials.materials.title": "Materials",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials.spears": "These spears act exactly like the Vanilla spears in Minecraft but in all of the different materials we support.",
  "manual.assortedtools.chapter.materials.spears.title": "Spears",
  "manual.assortedtools.description": "Tool and armor sets for every material, buckets that hold more than one, throwing weapons and the wands that do the digging for you.",
  "manual.assortedtools.title": "Assorted Tools",
